    "ff_forging_steps_20260730h": {
      "type": "ff-forging-process",
      "blocks": {
        "step_1": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "kicker": "FROM BILLET TO BLANK",
            "heading": "BILLET.",
            "number": "1",
            "text": "<p>Every Fortune Forged wheel starts as certified aerospace-grade 6061-T6 aluminum billet — chosen for strength-to-weight performance and the finish quality our builds are known for.</p><p>Material selection is the foundation. Get this wrong and nothing downstream can fix it.</p>",
            "media_style": "grid",
            "flip": false,
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/forza-manufacturing_7.webp",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_2128.jpg",
            "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_2125.jpg",
            "image_4": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2026-07-27_at_11.35.47_PM.png"
          }
        },
        "step_2": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "kicker": "DENSE GRAIN STRUCTURE",
            "heading": "FORGING.",
            "number": "2",
            "text": "<p>Under extreme heat and pressure, the billet is forged into a dense, directional grain structure. That process is what separates true forged performance from cast or flow-formed alternatives.</p><p>The result is a stronger blank we can machine aggressively without sacrificing integrity.</p>",
            "media_style": "solo",
            "flip": true,
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/forza-manufacturing_7.webp",
            "image_2": "",
            "image_3": "",
            "image_4": ""
          }
        },
        "step_3": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "kicker": "WHERE DESIGN COMES TO LIFE",
            "heading": "MILLING.",
            "number": "3",
            "text": "<p>Multi-axis CNC work sculpts the final design, spoke profile, and mounting geometry to exacting tolerances for fitment, balance, and brake clearance.</p><p>After machining, hand finishing stages — filing, deburring, and surface prep — bring every edge and face to a clean, consistent standard before coating.</p>",
            "media_style": "grid",
            "flip": false,
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_2142.jpg",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_2140.jpg",
            "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_2135.jpg",
            "image_4": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_2134.jpg"
          }
        },
        "step_4": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "kicker": "AMERICAN-MADE PRECISION",
            "heading": "HIGH SPEED MACHINING.",
            "number": "4",
            "text": "<p>We rely on modern CNC capacity to hold tight tolerances across complex spoke packages and deep concave profiles — the kind of geometry that only works when the machine work is exact.</p>",
            "media_style": "solo",
            "flip": false,
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_2128.jpg",
            "image_2": "",
            "image_3": "",
            "image_4": ""
          }
        },
        "step_5": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "kicker": "BUILT TO SHIP",
            "heading": "FINISH.",
            "number": "5",
            "text": "<p>From brushed and polished to custom powder coats, each set is finished to spec, then inspected before it ships — ready for the street, strip, or circuit.</p><p>Every wheel leaves as a precision instrument, not a generic catalog part.</p>",
            "media_style": "grid",
            "flip": true,
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_0840.jpg",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_2133.jpg",
            "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_0857.jpg",
            "image_4": "shopify://shop_images/HU9A6779.jpg"
          }
        },
        "cta_1": {
          "type": "cta",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Ready to build your set?",
            "button_label": "Shop wheels",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/all"
          }
        }
      },
